 Mill and Tega Cay driving high-end residential and commercial development, and jurisdiction lines matter here since growth spills across the York-Lancaster-Mecklenburg county line.</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:#888888;padding-top:6px;\">Source: U.S. Census Bureau · Data verified: August 30, 2026</div></div>"],"feats":[["York County",0,[[35.16484,-81.36694],[35.16376,-81.36822],[35.15848,-81.37481],[35.1576,-81.37572],[35.1547,-81.37928],[35.1482,-81.38714],[35.14267,-81.39392],[35.13678,-81.40125],[35.12633,-81.40226],[35.10357,-81.40431],[35.04643,-81.40957],[35.04892,-81.45336],[35.04864,-81.45345],[35.0482,-81.4535],[35.04777,-81.45365],[35.04744,-81.4537],[35.04717,-81.4538],[35.0471,-81.45398],[35.04716,-81.45461],[35.04698,-81.45528],[35.04693,-81.45597],[35.04685,-81.45627],[35.04671,-81.45652],[35.04669,-81.45667],[35.04671,-81.45679],[35.04679,-81.45691],[35.04676,-81.45702],[35.04687,-81.45722],[35.04677,-81.45741],[35.0468,-81.45748],[35.04707,-81.45756],[35.04722,-81.45772],[35.04751,-81.45819],[35.04812,-81.45868],[35.04831,-81.45877],[35.04837,-81.45891],[35.04828,-81.45915],[35.04815,-81.45931],[35.04812,-81.45947],[35.04815,-81.45965],[35.04828,-81.45995],[35.04829,-81.46017],[35.04822,-81.46037],[35.04807,-81.4605],[35.04792,-81.46085],[35.04795,-81.46095],[35.0481,-81.46112],[35.04818,-81.46132],[35.04812,-81.46144],[35.04792,-81.46149],[35.04759,-81.4615],[35.04746,-81.46159],[35.04737,-81.4616],[35.0472,-81.46152],[35.04672,-81.46147],[35.04631,-81.46185],[35.04605,-81.46192],[35.04598,-81.46202],[35.04595,-81.46249],[35.04585,-81.46277],[35.04589,-81.46332],[35.04563,-81.46407],[35.04563,-81.46449],[35.04569,-81.46469],[35.04616,-81.465],[35.04638,-81.4652],[35.04855,-81.46757],[35.04896,-81.46798],[35.0493,-81.46816],[35.04959,-81.46822],[35.05061,-81.46818],[35.05073,-81.4684],[35.05092,-81.46848],[35.05106,-81.4687],[35.05113,-81.46897],[35.05107,-81.46918],[35.05091,-81.46917],[35.05065,-81.46921],[35.05048,-81.46935],[35.05033,-8